docs {
  # Get My KYC Status
  
  Returns the logged-in user's current BillXpress tier and Maplerad customer status.
  
  ## Endpoint
  
  `GET /api/v1/users/me/kyc`
  
  ## Authentication
  
  Required.
  
  ```txt
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  ```
  
  ## Expected Response
  
  ```json
  {
    "user": {
      "authTier": "tier_1",
      "kycLevel": 0
    },
    "mapleradCustomer": null,
    "settings": {
      "bvnVerificationFee": 100,
      "currency": "NGN"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Frontend Notes

  Show `settings.bvnVerificationFee` before the user submits KYC. The user must
  have at least this amount in their main wallet.

  Suggested confirmation text:

  ```txt
  NGN 100 will be charged only if BVN verification succeeds. A temporary debit
  is refunded automatically if Maplerad rejects the verification. Confirm that
  your name and date of birth exactly match your BVN record.
  ```
}
